# 🧠 C# Quiz Game Application

An interactive desktop-based trivia quiz application built with **C#** and **Windows Forms**. This project demonstrates Object-Oriented Programming (OOP) principles, custom UI styling, and real-time score tracking.

---

## ✨ Features
* **OOP Architecture:** Questions and players are structured using clean Object-Oriented Programming design principles (`Soru` and `Yarismaci` classes).
* **Interactive Leaderboard:** Displays participant performance and historical scores using a custom-styled `DataGridView`.
* **Visual Answer Feedback:** Immediate visual feedback for correct (green) and incorrect (red) choices.
* **Automated Question Transitions:** Built-in timer logic for smooth delays between questions after an answer is selected.
* **Modern Dark Theme:** Styled UI components with a clean dark mode interface for better user experience.

---

## 🛠️ Tech Stack & Tools
* **Language:** C#
* **Framework:** .NET Framework / Windows Forms
* **IDE:** Visual Studio / VS Code

